1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,480
Did you know

2
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,440
a FISH carved

3
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,420
this circle?

4
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:03,720
Off southern JAPAN,

5
00:00:03,720 --> 00:00:04,540
a male PUFFERFISH

6
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:05,820
about 4 INCHES long

7
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:06,780
builds a nest

8
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:08,340
over 6 FEET wide.

9
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,523
Watch his FINS.

10
00:00:09,523 --> 00:00:10,260
He swims toward

11
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,120
the CENTER,

12
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:11,800
kicking SAND

13
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,020
to either side.

14
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:13,760
One pass cuts

15
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,008
a GROOVE.

16
00:00:15,008 --> 00:00:15,620
HUNDREDS of passes

17
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,380
leave a ring

18
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,380
of RIDGES.

19
00:00:17,380 --> 00:00:17,900
If a female

20
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:19,360
chooses this NEST,

21
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,240
she lays her EGGS

22
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,140
in the middle.

23
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:21,880
Can you SPOT him

24
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:22,733
now?
